 touch-ups"}],["$","p","5",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Washes out easily with water"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Made with clean, nourishing ingredients —gentle on scalp, great for daily use"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
