 use the tracking link to monitor your shipment status in real time."}],["$","h3","16",{"children":"Delivery Attempts & Address Accuracy"}],["$","p","17",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Please ensure your shipping address and contact details are correct at checkout."}],["$","p","18",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"If a delivery attempt fails due to an incorrect address or unavailability, re-shipping charges may apply."}],["$","h3","19",{"children":"Damaged or Lost Shipments"}],["$","p","20",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"In rare cases of transit damage or loss, please contact us within 48 hours of delivery."}],["$","p","21",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"We’ll investigate with our courier partner and arrange a replacement or resolution where applicable."}],["$","h3","22",{"children":"Need Help with Shipping?"}],["$","p","23",{"children":["If you have any questions or need updates regarding your shipment:"]}],["$","p","24",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"📧 Email us at: haxxedgroomingco@gmail.com"}],["$","p","25",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"💬 WhatsApp us via the chat box at the bottom right corner of our website"}],["$","p","26",{"children":["Our support team will be happy to assist you."]}]]}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Product & order questions ",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"inline-icon-link","href":"/haxxed-grooming-concept/pages/faq/","children":["Read the HAXXED FAQs ",["$","$L8",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$2:1:props:children:props:children:props:children:3:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
