:"Texture and airy volume"},{"name":"Beeswax","purpose":"Strong flexible hold"},{"name":"Arrowroot","purpose":"Lightweight oil absorption"},{"name":"Shea + olive oil","purpose":"Conditioning and softness"}],"howTo":["Blow-dry hair into the direction you want for extra lift.","Warm a small amount completely between your palms.","Rake through from the back, then shape the front.","Layer gradually to avoid weighing down fine hair."],"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/87BHVNCWOE.png?v=1759848954","altImage":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/lsiefreff.png?v=1759848954","video":"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/d1424af397fb4cb29ae373c75531a1f4/d1424af397fb4cb29ae373c75531a1f4.HD-720p-1.6Mbps-58655097.mp4?v=0","accent":"#6d75be","officialUrl":"https://haxxedgrooming.com/products/sculpting-cream","ratingApproximate":false}}],["$","$L1c","clay-pomade",{"product":{"slug":"clay-pomade","name":"CLAY POMADE","kind":"Hair","price":599,"mrp":799,"inStock":true,"hold":5,"shine":3,"holdLabel":"Extreme hold","finish":"Natural shine","bestFor":"Thick, dry hair","cardLine":"Extreme hold that lasts all day long","short":"The ultimate choice for those with thick and dry hair!","description":"The ultimate choice for those with thick and dry hair! Our preservative-free formula is crafted from 100% natural, high-quality ingredients including shea butter, olive oil, kaolin clay, and bentonite clay, providing unbeatable styling performance while nourishing your hair and scalp. With extreme hold, added thickness, texture, and volume, our clay pomade is also humidity and sweat resistant, ensuring a fresh and natural finish that lasts all day long.","benefits":["Extreme hold that lasts all day long","Natural shine for a clean, healthy look","Adds volume and texture from clay content","Oil-based formula, preservative-free and deeply conditioning","Ideal for structured & sculpted hairstyles","No flakes, no dryness, no compromises"],"ingredients":[{"name":"Kaolin + bentonite","purpose":"Dry grip, texture and volume"},{"name":"Beeswax","purpose":"Strong, flexible structure"},{"name":"Shea butter","purpose":"Softness and conditioning"},{"name":"Olive + coconut oil","purpose":"Nourishment and natural sheen"}],"howTo":["Start with dry or slightly damp hair.","Warm a fingertip-sized amount between both palms.","Work from roots to ends, then build only where you need more hold.","Use fingertips for texture or a comb for a cleaner shape."],"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/DNOBPM_S.png?v=1759848547","altImage":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/8ygiubj.png?v=1759848547","accent":"#6d625c","officialUrl":"https://haxxedgrooming.com/products/clay-pomade","ratingApproximate":false}}],"$L1d"]}]]}]
